Hi Anna,

ctmm.select() tries to be efficient in what models are included in the candidate pool. 325 selects OU anisotropic over OUF anisotropic and OUF isotropic and OUf anisotropic in the second round, so it tries IID anisotropic and OU isotropic in the third round, and failing to select either, it never proceeds to IID isotropic a the fourth round.
If there's ever a case where the IC-best model is not included, then feel free to let me know.

Best,
Chris

